>> title: Haemul Pajeon
>> category: Flatbreads & Pancakes
>> tags: korean, scallion, seafood, skillet, appetiser
>> counters: Ramen Shop
>> aka: pajeon, pajun, haemul pajun, seafood pancake, Korean scallion pancake
>> servings: 4
>> time: 30 min

Whisk @all-purpose flour{1%cup}(130 g), @potato starch{1/4%cup}(40 g), @fine sea salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g), and @ice water{1%cup}(240 mL) into a loose batter.

Beat @egg{1%large}(50 g) into @&(~1)batter{}.

Fold @chopped mixed seafood{6%oz}(170 g; squid and shrimp), @sliced scallions{8%stalks}(150 g) into @&(~1)batter{}.

>> step: fry in oil 4 min per side, until crisp
Fry @&(~1)batter{} in @vegetable oil{3%Tbsp}(45 mL) in a #skillet{} ~{4%min} per side, until lacy and crisp.
